              "title": "RHEL 8 must have the policycoreutils package installed.",
              "description": "<GroupDescription>Policycoreutils contains the policy core utilities that are required for basic operation of an SELinux-enabled system.</GroupDescription>"
            }
          ],
          "group_id": "V-230240",
