          "rule_version": "RHEL-08-040180",
          "rule_title": "The debug-shell systemd service must be disabled on RHEL 8.",
          "fix_text": "Configure the system to mask the debug-shell service with the following commands:\n\n$ sudo systemctl disable --now debug-shell.service\n$ sudo systemctl mask --now debug-shell.service",
          "weight": "10.0",
          "check_content": "Verify the debug-shell service is disabled with the following command:\n\n$ sudo systemctl status debug-shell.service\ndebug-shell.service\n   Loaded: masked (Reason: Unit debug-shell.service is masked.)\n   Active: inactive (dead)\n\nIf the debug-shell service is not masked and inactive, this is a finding.",
