          "rule_version": "RHEL-08-010070",
          "rule_title": "All RHEL 8 remote access methods must be monitored.",
          "fix_text": "Document the procedure for monitoring all remote access methods and obtain ISSO approval. Ensure the procedure is reviewed annually.",
          "weight": "10.0",
          "check_content": "Verify that RHEL 8 monitors all remote access methods.\n\nAsk the System Administrator to demonstrate how remote access sessions are monitored and logged. Review the documented procedure with the Information System Security Officer (ISSO).\n\nIf there is no documented procedure for monitoring remote access, this is a finding.",
          "check_content_ref": {
