          "rule_version": "RHEL-08-010600",
          "rule_title": "RHEL 8 must be maintained in a documented baseline configuration.",
          "fix_text": "Document the system baseline configuration and submit it to the configuration control board for approval. Review and update the baseline whenever an approved change is implemented.",
          "weight": "10.0",
          "check_content": "Verify the system is maintained in a documented baseline configuration.\n\nThe Information System Security Officer (ISSO) will verify that a baseline configuration document exists, is current, and that changes to the system are processed through the organization's configuration control board.\n\nIf no current baseline configuration document exists, this is a finding.",
