          "rule_version": "RHEL-08-010680",
          "rule_title": "RHEL 8 must be located in a controlled access area.",
          "fix_text": "Relocate the system to a controlled access area meeting the physical security requirements for its classification level, or obtain a documented risk acceptance from the Authorizing Official.",
          "weight": "10.0",
          "check_content": "Verify the system is located in a controlled access area.\n\nInspect the physical location of the system. The Information System Security Officer (ISSO) will confirm the area meets the physical security requirements for the system's classification level.\n\nIf the system is not located in a controlled access area, this is a finding.",
